{"id":"oferta","lemma":"oferta","pos":"noun","rank":1114,"glosses":["offer (a proposal that has been made)","offer (something put forth, bid, proffered or tendered)","supply"],"ipa":"/oˈfeɾta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ofertas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-oferta.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Esto está en oferta?","en":"Is this on sale?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831448"},{"text":"He ahí la oferta.","en":"That's the offer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443930"},{"text":"Es mi última oferta.","en":"It's my last offer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449305"},{"text":"Ella rechazó su oferta.","en":"She refused his offer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70040"},{"text":"La oferta fue rechazada.","en":"The offer was refused.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301860"}]}